OL,3,GNEWSA'My brother helped 17 people when
OL,4,Ahe died - we need more organ donors'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who campaigned for the organ
OL,7,Fdonor register to be established says
OL,8,Fmore people should have conversations
OL,9,Fabout their wishes after their death.
OL,11,FChristine Cox's brother Peter helped 17
OL,12,Fpeople when he died from a brain
OL,13,Ftumour, aged 24, including a
OL,14,Fgrandfather who got his heart and lived
OL,15,Ffor 12 more years.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
