OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'My brother helped 17 people when
OL,4,Ahe died - we need more organ donors'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe spoke as the NHS Blood and
OL,7,FTransplant announced its first urgent
OL,8,Fplan to address a "significant and
OL,9,Faccelerating decline" in organ
OL,10,Fdonation. It said only 1% of people in
OL,11,Fthe UK die in circumstances where
OL,12,Fdonation is possible and the pool of
OL,13,Feligible donors has reduced by around
OL,14,F20% since 2019/20.
OL,16,FCox said: "It is really vital we get
OL,17,Fanother, at least, one million people
OL,18,Fonto that register in the next few
OL,19,Fmonths."
